les":{"commits":{"digest":"cce68d1d6c822a561a538fa5ba385b5a0365151622cc0d5eb1ed258316033bb5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ba.1/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ba.1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"c0994576893d1e1ff66856ef5cfb1679d4b4a770bd727b62bc15f3d85bf929b3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ba.1/meta.json","size_bytes":5711},"prompt":{"digest":"204f0d07219a342c438143b99bc060d5947dd605d456dcc2270518e8bd2fb147","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ba.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":182},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"4e56d1fe88977294d9224f1d843762989cdb841cde49f046ed4a8ebe2c43bdd6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ba.1/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4134},"state":{"digest":"bb7e285824290955b4a14dd617bbb05492b5e82bbb36abec2502167b9af1a73c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ba.1/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-ba.1","local_name":"sase-ba.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-ba","agent_clan_generation":"20260730104240","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-ba.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-ba[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Give the artifact store a lifecycle - report, dry-run pruning, and [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]opt-in retention[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The artifact-file store can be measured, drained, and bounded: [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`sase artifact stats` reports its economics, `sase artifact prune` [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and `sase artifact reclaim` are dry-run by default and route every [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]removal through a restorable trash, an opt-in `artifacts.retention`[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]policy keeps the store bounded going forward, and nothing an agent [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]declared or a bead, plan, or ChangeSpec references is ever removed.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]artifact_store_lifecycle.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-ba[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-ba/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust core: store economics, retention planner, and trash [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]primitives[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]core-lifecycle[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-lifecycle: add a pure store-economics aggregator, a pure retention [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]planner, and clock-free trash store/list/restore/purge primitives to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`sase_core`, expose all four through `sase_core_rs`, and release the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]crate.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Store economics report and the protected-reference scan[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]py-report[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-lifecycle[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]py-report: raise the `sase-core-rs` pin, add the Python bridges for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]economics and retention planning, add the bead/plan/ChangeSpec reference[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scan that produces protected artifact ids, and ship `sase artifact [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stats` as a read-only report with a JSON mode.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Dry-run-first pruning and the trash lifecycle[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]py-prune[dim] · [dim][/dim]after py-report[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]py-prune: add `sase artifact prune` (dry run unless `--apply`) and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`sase artifact trash {list,purge,restore}` group, with index-row removal[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and restoration performed under the existing index lock and every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]removal routed through the trash.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Retroactive version-control reclaim of the pooled bytes[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]py-reclaim[dim] · [dim][/dim]after py-prune[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]py-reclaim: add `sase artifact reclaim`, which converts stored automatic[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows whose exact content is reproducible from a durable ref into [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]byte-free VCS-backed rows and trashes the redundant copies, reusing the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture policy's git probe and verifying by digest first.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Opt-in retention configuration and enforcement[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]retention-config[dim] · [dim][/dim]after py-prune[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]retention-config: add the `artifacts.retention` configuration block [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]defaulting to disabled, its schema entries and accessors, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bounded, fail-safe enforcement pass that runs after automatic capture at[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]finalization and purges expired trash.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation, skill, and configuration reference[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs-and-skill[dim] · [dim][/dim]after py-reclaim, retention-config[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs-and-skill: document the store lifecycle, the new subcommands, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]trash contract, and the retention block across the CLI, configuration, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and artifact docs, and refresh the `sase_artifact_file` skill source and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]its deployed copy.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ba","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-ba.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-163254d0efbba308521b85865a89d938","started_at":"2026-07-30T14:42:54.371891+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"e65be7fa3edafaead23fdc690a720b04a3a980d6bd9cfe14b6bec3ec1d5c5aed","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ba.4/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"881dbf69244b1fd7898fe4857f3883525a4fab1d3abd441a03cc494783db6a51","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ba.4/meta.json","size_bytes":603},"prompt":{"digest":"21831bb9e5a27e215444900befcc9dd91ea96934a638e92d07dc9ee4620f66de","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ba.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":154},"state":{"digest":"800edb6f7a02e74ab6035a3659598f270281a413cb7c9c93ca3c91296f70d11b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ba.4/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-ba.4","local_name":"sase-ba.4","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-ba","agent_clan_generation":"20260730104240","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-ba.4","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ba","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-ba.4","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-52400a89f3bd85ee4435f839134c7acc","started_at":"20260730104243","state":"waiting"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"327735b5af31d9abce7a2252418b8d73f2997d3f7ff41ddf31fd7a4c6b7d9b6a","path":"agents/bbug